{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the co-creator of Eufloria</strong> and <strong>Receiver 2</strong> comes a new indie extravaganza!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use supercharged <strong>photography</strong> to explore one of the deepest and most <strong>emergent ecosystems</strong> in games. Part Metroidvania, part <i>future science expedition</i>, Bioframe gives players the means to master a vast world in which <strong>all creatures react to each other in complex ways</strong>, with frequently unexpected results.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the player understands their environment, the more they can <strong>find outrageous ways</strong> to make creatures part of gameplay solutions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.poster.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.webm?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.mp4?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Out of the Box</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe\u2019s eco system is so dynamic that players can <strong>create their own gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No torch for that dark, dangerous cave?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Photo-Stun</i></strong><i> a </i><strong><i>Laser Plant</i></strong><i> to steal its </i><strong><i>Glow Orb</i></strong><i>, stick it on a nervous </i><strong><i>Lizard</i></strong><i>, drive it ahead of you, and it will</i><strong><i> light the way</i></strong><i> while you follow at a safe distance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless ways players can create useful outcomes and develop new tactics. Snapping creatures doesn\u2019t just <strong>stun</strong> them, it also unlocks all their <strong><i>behavioural quirks</i></strong> contained in their many AI states.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.poster.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.webm?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.mp4?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lateral Thinking Not Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe avoids guns and any other cliched weapons.<strong> Everything in the world can be used,</strong> offensively or defensively, according to player preference and their knowledge of the world. <strong>Lateral thinking is key</strong> and easily rewarded.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are <strong>vampiric butterflies</strong> in the way? <strong>Lure</strong> them with their <strong>favourite food</strong> and <strong>add them to your inventory</strong> to create a <strong>portable attack swarm</strong>. Release them near enemies and <strong>they clear the way for you</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe offers unparalleled freedom to enterprising players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/d80938e09a1276b550a65900e538e90a.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive narrative-driven single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast interactive open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the deepest ecosystems of its kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge number of creatures with distinct AI states and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photography mechanic adds spice and meaning to exploration gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing ambient OST by the musician behind Eufloria</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Librarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/5c83d597099d3aa0e2261d22ba056aa64cca5116.jpg"},{"name":"Reportage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/c407d4a91ad22c8114b8235e10102ee468501365.jpg"},{"name":"Locksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/e8a02872580ced02ff97ec1fde95973fd208d010.jpg"},{"name":"Hacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/467f9b8074df3bbbb4568be908ea862848a4102f.jpg"},{"name":"Montage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/b16dd1a4c2d5b9c13e3300aa2348fbebef7b845c.jpg"},{"name":"Illuminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/48d4de5262bc06794c5b612f79241a0c9afeb578.jpg"},{"name":"Action Shooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/a2f2a51643fdff2b538e63f9c69506e7e088c5b5.jpg"},{"name":"Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/c7c37baac7de5cce3e0648d3a8ad030cc574c7d0.jpg"},{"name":"High Flyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/4df4db806a04bfef39bcc8ae83fdf880f4935342.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/463730/f5a315d11a88868fa2b23d02f194e92e63b88309.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/463730?t=1773245313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/463730?t=1773245313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/dc71b683471c446a357836c00bd708c19c710da9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773245313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/dc71b683471c446a357836c00bd708c19c710da9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773245313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2133340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.poster.avif?t=1773245313\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.webm?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/988aaab3699f980e6f7da3493fa66c2a.mp4?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the co-creator of Eufloria</strong> and <strong>Receiver 2</strong> comes a new indie extravaganza!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use supercharged <strong>photography</strong> to explore one of the deepest and most <strong>emergent ecosystems</strong> in games. Part Metroidvania, part <i>future science expedition</i>, Bioframe gives players the means to master a vast world in which <strong>all creatures react to each other in complex ways</strong>, with frequently unexpected results.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the player understands their environment, the more they can <strong>find outrageous ways</strong> to make creatures part of gameplay solutions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.poster.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.webm?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/6476a2bed6f222c1ae0bd40c690611e4.mp4?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Out of the Box</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe\u2019s eco system is so dynamic that players can <strong>create their own gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No torch for that dark, dangerous cave?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Photo-Stun</i></strong><i> a </i><strong><i>Laser Plant</i></strong><i> to steal its </i><strong><i>Glow Orb</i></strong><i>, stick it on a nervous </i><strong><i>Lizard</i></strong><i>, drive it ahead of you, and it will</i><strong><i> light the way</i></strong><i> while you follow at a safe distance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless ways players can create useful outcomes and develop new tactics. Snapping creatures doesn\u2019t just <strong>stun</strong> them, it also unlocks all their <strong><i>behavioural quirks</i></strong> contained in their many AI states.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.poster.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.webm?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/987c8da757dd9be8096695442a51ea6a.mp4?t=1773245313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lateral Thinking Not Guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe avoids guns and any other cliched weapons.<strong> Everything in the world can be used,</strong> offensively or defensively, according to player preference and their knowledge of the world. <strong>Lateral thinking is key</strong> and easily rewarded.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are <strong>vampiric butterflies</strong> in the way? <strong>Lure</strong> them with their <strong>favourite food</strong> and <strong>add them to your inventory</strong> to create a <strong>portable attack swarm</strong>. Release them near enemies and <strong>they clear the way for you</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bioframe offers unparalleled freedom to enterprising players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/extras/d80938e09a1276b550a65900e538e90a.avif?t=1773245313\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive narrative-driven single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast interactive open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the deepest ecosystems of its kind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge number of creatures with distinct AI states and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photography mechanic adds spice and meaning to exploration gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing ambient OST by the musician behind Eufloria</p></li></ul>","developers":["Omni Systems"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/463730/141a10d818038bbb647caee0baac3908cfff328c/header.jpg?t=1773245313","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2022 Omni Systems Limited","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/463730/351630431/37a5bd45500617e92d49f1b314bc0abd008d818f/1759230665/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759233656","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/463730/351630431/37a5bd45500617e92d49f1b314bc0abd008d818f/1759230665/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759233656","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/463730/351630431/37a5bd45500617e92d49f1b314bc0abd008d818f/1759230665/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759233656","id":257209219,"name":"Bioframe Outpost Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209219/4580b6446a502e41c3089264663e050758e6ebcc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759233656"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/463730/701641255/df00509e966fb9dbde3d3ce8dc516f8235e32dfe/1759238559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759241753","dash_h264":"https://